WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.400 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 27]

01:42.310 --> 01:43.240
Uncle Jingdong,

01:44.280 --> 01:47.680
for defending me
in front of the clan elders today,

01:49.350 --> 01:50.550
I'd like to thank you.

01:51.509 --> 01:52.560
No need for that.

01:54.430 --> 01:55.710
I came back too late

01:56.160 --> 01:58.420
to save you from unnecessary suffering.

01:58.830 --> 01:59.960
Come on, take a seat.

02:08.550 --> 02:10.759
These clan elders of Li Ink

02:11.190 --> 02:13.680
are provided for by the Li family,

02:14.030 --> 02:16.070
but they are never helpful
at critical times.

02:16.070 --> 02:17.840
Instead, they cause extra trouble.

02:17.840 --> 02:18.800
To be honest,

02:18.960 --> 02:21.560
I contradicted them a lot
when I was young.

02:21.590 --> 02:22.910
If I had arrived earlier today,

02:22.910 --> 02:25.170
they wouldn't have been even allowed in.

02:30.840 --> 02:31.770
Uncle Jingdong.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.800
Over these years, you had never

02:35.800 --> 02:37.630
addressed me as your niece

02:38.400 --> 02:40.530
in outsiders' presence before today.

02:42.030 --> 02:43.160
I should have done it

02:43.280 --> 02:44.360
a long time ago.

02:47.430 --> 02:48.030
Oh right.

02:49.710 --> 02:52.240
Don't hold a grudge
against your eldest aunt.

02:52.280 --> 02:54.280
She has always been reasonable

02:54.520 --> 02:56.910
and stood by your side.

02:57.030 --> 02:59.520
I don't know what got into her today.

03:00.750 --> 03:01.400
It was simply because

03:01.400 --> 03:04.130
she was instigated
by Li Decai and Tian Jiangyue.

03:04.150 --> 03:05.520
I saw it all today.

03:05.960 --> 03:07.560
The one who fanned the flames

03:07.750 --> 03:09.480
was most likely Tian Jiangyue.

03:11.890 --> 03:13.350
It's Tian Jiangyue again.

03:13.680 --> 03:15.190
It's her doing again.

03:15.680 --> 03:16.520
Uncle Jingdong,

03:16.520 --> 03:17.840
our priority now

03:18.079 --> 03:19.280
is to catch the isinglass dealer

03:19.280 --> 03:20.630
and get his testimony.

03:21.000 --> 03:23.060
Besides, we need to buy raw materials

03:23.120 --> 03:25.120
to make up for the damaged ink in time.

03:25.120 --> 03:26.120
You are right.

03:26.520 --> 03:28.180
I'll give it serious thought.

03:29.280 --> 03:31.810
Benchang, Tian Jiangyue had a message
delivered to us in secret,

03:31.810 --> 03:34.060
asking us to keep a close eye
on that isinglass dealer.

03:34.060 --> 03:37.120
She's worried if Li Zhen will get anything
on us and her.

03:39.079 --> 03:40.630
Our third aunt truly

03:41.190 --> 03:42.430
has a huge appetite.

03:44.630 --> 03:46.150
How's the isinglass dealer now?

03:46.150 --> 03:47.880
Our men have been watching him.

04:01.590 --> 04:02.520
Remove

04:02.800 --> 04:03.590
our men.

04:04.840 --> 04:06.030
Why?

04:06.520 --> 04:08.030
If the isinglass dealer is found,

04:08.030 --> 04:09.800
won't all our efforts be wasted?

04:09.800 --> 04:12.060
This matter concerns Huizhou scholars.

04:12.840 --> 04:16.700
It might become a bigger issue
as the autumn imperial exam draws near.

04:17.120 --> 04:18.519
We must steer clear of it.

04:18.950 --> 04:20.430
But right now, our urgent task is...

04:20.430 --> 04:22.029
I know what you're thinking.

04:23.630 --> 04:24.690
But this chess game

04:24.920 --> 04:26.070
requires patience.

04:27.480 --> 04:30.010
We've achieved the goal
of the current phase.

04:31.680 --> 04:32.320
This...

04:34.830 --> 04:35.950
Why a sudden increase

04:35.950 --> 04:37.880
in the orders for Styrax resin ink?

04:38.560 --> 04:40.090
This is just the beginning.

04:41.310 --> 04:43.120
Once word about Li Ink's trouble spread,

04:43.120 --> 04:44.510
some tutors already switched

04:44.510 --> 04:45.970
to placing orders with me.

04:46.480 --> 04:48.070
I've had all the isinglass available

04:48.070 --> 04:49.470
on the market bought out.

04:49.510 --> 04:51.120
By the time Li Ink needs
to deliver orders,

04:51.120 --> 04:52.980
they won't have anything to give.

04:53.870 --> 04:54.960
When that happens,

04:55.830 --> 04:57.240
our Styrax resin ink

04:57.310 --> 04:59.120
won't be at its current price.

05:00.000 --> 05:01.600
This is a brilliant plan, Benchang.

05:01.600 --> 05:02.930
It really is brilliant.

05:25.630 --> 05:26.560
Rujun,

05:28.920 --> 05:30.430
it's time you woke up.

05:32.470 --> 05:34.310
There's a fight going on at home.

05:36.870 --> 05:40.190
The burden on Zhen is too heavy.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.980
I'm afraid she can't bear it anymore.

06:01.360 --> 06:02.160
Rujun.

06:04.720 --> 06:05.430
Zhen...

06:06.160 --> 06:07.160
Rujun.

06:07.870 --> 06:10.270
Zhen...

06:10.950 --> 06:11.870
Rujun.

06:15.270 --> 06:16.950
You finally woke up.

06:21.070 --> 06:21.950
Rujun,

06:23.950 --> 06:25.310
you finally woke up!

06:28.270 --> 06:29.430
Hua'er, where are you

06:29.430 --> 06:31.030
taking me this late at night?

06:31.180 --> 06:32.370
Zhen, stop asking.

06:32.470 --> 06:34.430
Just come with me.

06:34.870 --> 06:35.390
Come.

06:59.800 --> 07:01.060
Seventh Grandmother.

07:02.120 --> 07:03.270
You finally came to.

07:04.480 --> 07:06.270
I was so scared for you.

07:07.750 --> 07:08.800
I thought...

07:08.800 --> 07:11.310
I thought you would never wake up.

07:11.310 --> 07:13.680
Don't cry.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.630
I haven't

07:16.630 --> 07:20.870
seen the ink you newly created.

07:21.240 --> 07:25.040
How could I bring myself
to leave you forever?

07:26.310 --> 07:27.360
Don't cry.

07:28.070 --> 07:29.240
Stop crying.

07:30.630 --> 07:33.560
I'm awake now, aren't I?

07:33.560 --> 07:35.070
Don't cry.

07:35.270 --> 07:36.560
Seventh Grandmother.

07:38.159 --> 07:39.240
I'm incompetent.

07:41.390 --> 07:44.000
I can't manage the family well.

07:45.159 --> 07:46.870
I have failed you.

07:46.950 --> 07:47.950
Zhen,

07:49.510 --> 07:53.070
I'm the one who has failed you.

07:56.159 --> 07:57.430
Hua'er

07:57.560 --> 08:01.600
already told me what happened at home.

08:02.360 --> 08:06.270
It's my fault for having weak health

08:06.870 --> 08:08.720
and collapsing.

08:09.920 --> 08:11.000
And I didn't

08:11.000 --> 08:13.160
make things clear

08:14.000 --> 08:16.560
to your eldest aunt.

08:17.630 --> 08:18.890
Seventh Grandmother.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.600
Although I don't have any proof,

08:22.310 --> 08:24.680
I'm aware that this matter is related

08:24.800 --> 08:26.750
to Tian Jiangyue and Li Decai.

08:27.870 --> 08:28.750
I know.

08:28.950 --> 08:31.750
They're resorting to every means
to drive me away.

08:32.200 --> 08:34.460
When the ink recipe was leaked last time,

08:34.630 --> 08:37.200
though it seemed like I left in anger,

08:38.200 --> 08:39.320
at the heart of it,

08:40.270 --> 08:42.470
I was just running away from adversity.

08:42.960 --> 08:44.090
However, this time,

08:45.240 --> 08:47.300
since I've taken the responsibility

08:47.360 --> 08:49.360
of managing the household from you,

08:50.150 --> 08:53.080
Seventh Grandmother,
I will not back off even a step.

08:54.000 --> 08:55.080
Zhen,

08:56.320 --> 08:57.790
don't worry.

08:58.750 --> 09:00.840
Now that I've come to,

09:01.790 --> 09:04.510
no one will dare to bully you again.

09:06.000 --> 09:07.260
Seventh Grandmother,

09:07.670 --> 09:08.960
put your mind at ease.

09:10.120 --> 09:11.030
Now,

09:11.320 --> 09:13.200
I am no longer by myself.

09:14.270 --> 09:16.840
Uncle Jingdong is helping me
figure out ways

09:16.840 --> 09:18.370
to speed up ink production,

09:18.670 --> 09:21.930
and Master Qi is searching
for the isinglass dealer for me.

09:22.000 --> 09:23.860
Now that you've finally woken up,

09:24.360 --> 09:25.720
I immediately feel

09:26.550 --> 09:28.670
strength surging through my body.

09:33.550 --> 09:35.320
My dearest Zhen,

09:36.780 --> 09:38.750
you've really grown up.

09:39.720 --> 09:41.320
Good.

09:41.510 --> 09:43.200
This is good.

09:45.210 --> 09:47.610
All of you, listen.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.440
Do not let anyone else

09:51.080 --> 09:53.960
know I have come to.

09:54.670 --> 09:56.150
Only in this way

09:57.600 --> 09:59.000
can Zhen

09:59.360 --> 10:00.870
handle all affairs

10:01.640 --> 10:03.440
more resolutely

10:03.750 --> 10:05.840
and more easily.

10:20.390 --> 10:21.390
Li Decai,

10:21.720 --> 10:23.840
didn't I say no meeting
for these few days?

10:23.840 --> 10:25.080
Fourth Sister-in-law,

10:25.080 --> 10:26.320
Eldest Young Master Tian

10:26.320 --> 10:28.000
got our message early this morning,

10:28.000 --> 10:30.910
but still hasn't replied
up to this moment.

10:31.390 --> 10:33.320
I spent a whole day today
waiting at the gate

10:33.320 --> 10:34.600
of the Tian residence.

10:34.720 --> 10:36.630
Then I finally met
Second Young Master Tian,

10:36.630 --> 10:37.600
Tian Bensheng.

10:37.840 --> 10:40.670
I asked him
how the isinglass dealer was doing,

10:40.840 --> 10:42.870
yet he played dumb with me.

10:43.540 --> 10:45.910
If the Tian family stands aside
and does nothing,

10:45.910 --> 10:48.320
Qi Jiu will catch that isinglass dealer

10:48.320 --> 10:50.000
sooner or later.

10:50.120 --> 10:51.180
When that happens,

10:51.240 --> 10:53.550
what will become of us?

10:56.960 --> 10:58.290
Fourth Sister-in-law.

11:00.200 --> 11:01.720
Fourth Sister-in-law!

11:03.750 --> 11:05.610
You were the one who instructed me

11:05.630 --> 11:07.120
to ask the isinglass dealer

11:07.120 --> 11:08.870
to tamper with those barrels.

11:09.030 --> 11:10.600
It was also you who told me to disclose

11:10.600 --> 11:12.440
the information to the Tian family.

11:12.440 --> 11:14.720
You can't just leave me in the lurch,

11:14.720 --> 11:16.050
Fourth Sister-in-law.

11:16.840 --> 11:17.870
Li Decai,

11:18.630 --> 11:20.440
watch your mouth.

11:21.720 --> 11:22.600
Listen,

11:22.960 --> 11:25.550
I have nothing to do with this matter.

11:25.740 --> 11:27.310
Don't make me go over to the Third Brother

11:27.310 --> 11:29.970
and reveal the secret
of you keeping a mistress.

12:01.790 --> 12:03.440
M-Master Qi.

12:04.620 --> 12:06.150
W-What are you doing here?

12:07.270 --> 12:09.070
Tasting the fish you raise here.

12:11.140 --> 12:13.200
The fish is at its plumpest right now.

12:13.720 --> 12:15.440
E-Enjoy it, gentlemen.

12:15.630 --> 12:16.550
I need to be away

12:16.630 --> 12:18.200
f-for some matters.

12:18.720 --> 12:19.390
Goodbye.

12:19.510 --> 12:20.840
Did I allow you to leave?

12:20.960 --> 12:21.390
I...

12:23.710 --> 12:25.040
The fish is indeed nice.

12:26.910 --> 12:28.670
But there's something wrong

12:29.200 --> 12:30.400
with your isinglass.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.670
Master Qi,

12:34.200 --> 12:36.030
when the delivery was made,

12:36.030 --> 12:37.830
you already examined the goods.

12:38.080 --> 12:40.030
Once the transaction is done,

12:40.440 --> 12:41.870
any good or bad outcomes

12:41.870 --> 12:43.270
won't have anything to do with me.

12:43.270 --> 12:45.750
I'm just an honest businessman.

12:47.110 --> 12:47.770
Not so hard!

12:48.390 --> 12:50.630
N-N-Not so hard.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.680
You just won't confess, huh?

12:55.170 --> 12:57.170
I have nothing to confess to. I...

12:57.200 --> 12:57.750
Hold it.

12:59.090 --> 12:59.760
Hold it!

13:04.750 --> 13:06.670
Try it. See if I grilled it well.

13:06.790 --> 13:08.150
Then you're free to go.

13:09.750 --> 13:11.610
I can go a-after eating it, right?

13:12.600 --> 13:13.120
Fine.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.390
I-I'll eat it.

13:18.200 --> 13:19.200
Goodbye then.

13:20.080 --> 13:21.510
N-Not so hard, sir.

13:23.600 --> 13:24.320
Keep eating.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.720
I... I...

13:33.000 --> 13:33.670
Don't hurt me.

13:33.670 --> 13:34.510
Please spare my life.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.440
This blade

13:35.870 --> 13:37.790
took many lives years ago.

13:38.630 --> 13:40.960
It hasn't tasted blood for a long time
in recent two years.

13:40.960 --> 13:42.390
Take three more bites.

13:42.870 --> 13:43.800
When you finish,

13:44.480 --> 13:45.940
I'll end your life myself.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.480
No, please spare me.

13:47.480 --> 13:48.550
I said, eat it.

13:49.030 --> 13:49.720
Yes, I'll eat it.

13:49.720 --> 13:50.840
I'll eat it! I will!

13:51.960 --> 13:52.960
Three bites.

13:56.750 --> 13:57.510
Two bites.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.390
No!

14:00.600 --> 14:01.440
I'll talk.

14:02.080 --> 14:03.030
I'll talk!

14:03.030 --> 14:04.200
I'll tell you everything.

14:04.200 --> 14:06.120
Master Qi, I'll tell you everything.

14:06.120 --> 14:07.630
Please just spare my life.

14:08.160 --> 14:09.440
This is more like it.

14:10.020 --> 14:12.330
[Li Ink]

14:14.840 --> 14:15.600
Thank you.

14:15.910 --> 14:17.080
We guessed it right.

14:17.360 --> 14:18.480
That isinglass dealer

14:18.480 --> 14:19.870
sneaked back

14:20.080 --> 14:21.210
to check on his fish,

14:21.240 --> 14:22.970
so we could catch him in the act.

14:23.240 --> 14:24.270
I've handed him over to Doggie

14:24.270 --> 14:25.360
and had him locked up.

14:25.360 --> 14:26.710
Have you got anything out of him?

14:26.710 --> 14:27.760
According to him, over a month ago,

14:27.760 --> 14:28.720
Li Decai already

14:28.720 --> 14:30.510
promised him a great deal of silver

14:30.510 --> 14:32.600
and a ten-year contract with him being

14:32.600 --> 14:33.790
the isinglass supplier

14:33.790 --> 14:35.080
for the Li Ink Workshop.

14:35.080 --> 14:37.550
It seems Li Decai has long
made up his mind

14:37.550 --> 14:38.810
to force me to step down

14:38.870 --> 14:40.360
and to take control of the Li family.

14:40.360 --> 14:42.910
Cunning though he is,
he isn't exactly bright.

14:42.910 --> 14:44.270
Since he's out in the open,

14:44.270 --> 14:45.840
I bet someone's scheming in the shadows.

14:45.840 --> 14:46.270
Agreed.

14:46.270 --> 14:47.840
I have another finding.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.720
Li Decai's mistress in Suzhou

14:49.960 --> 14:52.030
was secretly brought back to Huizhou.

14:52.030 --> 14:53.790
The person who arranged that

14:53.790 --> 14:55.120
was exactly Tian Benchang.

14:55.120 --> 14:58.510
Tian Benchang has long harbored hatred
toward the Li family.

14:58.510 --> 15:00.240
He would definitely target us.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.750
However, on his own, it was difficult

15:01.750 --> 15:03.200
to find such a despicable lowlife

15:03.200 --> 15:04.960
like Li Decai to do his bidding.

15:05.840 --> 15:08.550
The intermediary
between Li Decai and Tian Benchang

15:08.550 --> 15:10.080
is the real mastermind.

15:10.360 --> 15:11.000
Who is it?

15:12.240 --> 15:13.790
Who else could it be

15:14.010 --> 15:15.210
if not my fourth aunt?

15:24.150 --> 15:25.000
Catch him!

15:29.080 --> 15:30.240
Hurry, catch him!

15:30.270 --> 15:30.870
Li Decai!

15:30.870 --> 15:31.550
Catch him!

15:46.480 --> 15:47.410
Are you alright?

15:48.270 --> 15:49.870
Li Decai is heading for the front yard!

15:49.870 --> 15:51.390
Go get him in the front yard. Quick!

15:51.390 --> 15:51.840
Get up!

15:51.840 --> 15:53.510
That way. That way.

15:54.000 --> 15:55.000
Clear the stuff!

16:06.320 --> 16:07.360
Li Decai!

16:10.990 --> 16:12.590
That punk's running so fast.

16:16.910 --> 16:17.630
Uncle!

16:18.720 --> 16:19.720
Li Decai!

16:20.440 --> 16:21.750
Get up now!

16:22.510 --> 16:24.320
Hold still! Stay where you are!

16:24.320 --> 16:25.270
Back off, all of you!

16:25.270 --> 16:26.330
What are you doing?

16:26.390 --> 16:26.670
Zhengyou!

16:26.670 --> 16:27.080
Mother!

16:27.080 --> 16:27.840
Back off!

16:28.360 --> 16:29.510
Fine. Just don't hurt the child!

16:29.510 --> 16:30.150
Help me!

16:30.150 --> 16:31.000
Li Decai,

16:31.080 --> 16:32.150
release Zhengyou.

16:32.150 --> 16:33.510
We can talk everything out.

16:33.510 --> 16:34.480
Shut up.

16:35.150 --> 16:36.390
If I fall into your hands,

16:36.390 --> 16:37.790
I'll be dead meat.

16:37.840 --> 16:39.550
Right now, this little brat

16:39.670 --> 16:41.790
can keep me from harm.

16:42.440 --> 16:44.440
Heaven hasn't forsaken me.

16:44.910 --> 16:46.440
All of you, step back!

16:46.480 --> 16:48.150
Decai, don't hurt Zhengyou!

16:48.410 --> 16:50.170
You watched him grow up.

16:50.190 --> 16:51.270
How could you do this to him?

16:51.270 --> 16:53.030
Are you even human?

16:53.030 --> 16:54.080
Cut the crap!

16:54.390 --> 16:57.080
When has the Li family ever treated me
like a human?

16:57.080 --> 16:57.790
Step aside, you!

16:57.790 --> 16:58.630
Li Decai,

16:59.510 --> 17:01.440
you just want a hostage, don't you?

17:01.750 --> 17:02.480
Fine.

17:03.080 --> 17:04.550
I'm the manager of Li Ink.

17:05.440 --> 17:06.970
Take me as hostage instead.

17:08.160 --> 17:09.270
I'll be at your disposal.

17:09.270 --> 17:10.530
Don't come any closer!

17:13.480 --> 17:14.790
You're asking me to let go of him

17:14.790 --> 17:15.990
and take you instead?

17:16.410 --> 17:18.079
What are you even thinking?

17:18.109 --> 17:19.569
Do I look like a fool to you?

17:19.589 --> 17:21.480
He's little
so I can have him under control.

17:21.480 --> 17:22.740
But you're different.

17:22.750 --> 17:24.480
Don't you dare pull any stunts with me.

17:24.480 --> 17:25.609
I'm telling you lot,

17:25.880 --> 17:27.160
if you want him to live,

17:27.160 --> 17:28.510
you'll have to obey me!

17:28.510 --> 17:29.200
Fine!

17:29.920 --> 17:30.960
We'll obey you.

17:31.440 --> 17:32.270
Tell us.

17:32.880 --> 17:34.210
What do you want from us?

17:36.510 --> 17:38.170
Give me1,000 taels of silver.

17:39.030 --> 17:40.290
A horse carriage, too.

17:40.880 --> 17:41.510
Plus,

17:42.510 --> 17:43.350
you must

17:44.110 --> 17:45.510
bring Rong

17:45.550 --> 17:47.030
and Yun here right now!

17:47.310 --> 17:49.310
Once we're safe after driving the carriage

17:49.310 --> 17:50.240
out of town,

17:50.310 --> 17:51.790
I'll set this little brat free.

17:51.790 --> 17:52.680
Li Decai,

17:52.680 --> 17:54.640
this is not going to happen for you!

17:54.640 --> 17:56.680
Shut up, you cripple!

17:56.680 --> 17:57.960
How dare you call me that?

17:57.960 --> 17:59.830
Decai, I beg you.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.350
I beg you!

18:01.350 --> 18:02.750
Don't you speak nonsense to me anymore.

18:02.750 --> 18:03.440
Believe it or not,

18:03.440 --> 18:04.720
I'll kill him right now!

18:04.720 --> 18:06.050
I agree with your terms!

18:06.550 --> 18:07.270
Go.

18:07.640 --> 18:08.680
Do as he said!

18:08.700 --> 18:09.500
Hurry!

18:11.790 --> 18:12.590
Li Decai,

18:13.270 --> 18:14.440
release Zhengyou now.

18:14.440 --> 18:15.200
Mother?

18:15.510 --> 18:17.110
Li Decai, listen up,

18:17.400 --> 18:19.240
if anything happens to Zhengyou today,

18:19.240 --> 18:21.590
I, Zhao Jin, won't let you leave
the Li residence!

18:21.590 --> 18:22.790
You crazy woman.

18:23.160 --> 18:25.050
Haven't you been kicked out
by the Li family?

18:25.050 --> 18:26.200
You're no better than a stray dog.

18:26.200 --> 18:27.510
What does this matter have to do with you?

18:27.510 --> 18:29.920
Right, the Li family's affairs
are not my business.

18:29.920 --> 18:31.310
But Zhengyou is my nephew,

18:31.310 --> 18:32.550
and Wanyi is my sister-in-law.

18:32.550 --> 18:34.400
When you hurt them, you hurt me.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.730
I won't stay out of this matter!

18:37.110 --> 18:37.880
Li Decai,

18:37.960 --> 18:39.000
let go of Zhengyou.

18:39.000 --> 18:40.510
Or my blade will make you regret it!

18:40.510 --> 18:41.510
D-Don't come any closer.

18:41.510 --> 18:42.350
Stay away!

18:44.270 --> 18:45.270
Zhengyou!

18:45.550 --> 18:46.350
Zhengyou!

18:46.790 --> 18:47.590
Mother!

18:48.310 --> 18:49.070
Tie him up.

18:49.240 --> 18:50.640
Keep him in the woodshed.

18:50.850 --> 18:52.380
Are you alright, Zhengyou?

18:53.830 --> 18:56.160
You were acting tough just now,
weren't you?

18:56.160 --> 18:56.920
What now?

18:57.820 --> 18:59.220
Why not continue to yell?

19:02.170 --> 19:03.090
Li Decai,

19:03.680 --> 19:05.510
I suggest you confess

19:05.790 --> 19:07.510
before I do anything to you.

19:07.750 --> 19:08.680
Zhen,

19:09.930 --> 19:11.670
I know I did wrong.

19:11.880 --> 19:14.160
Please forgive me, your uncle, this once,

19:14.160 --> 19:16.750
for the sake of Aunt Chunhua.

19:18.590 --> 19:19.830
"Uncle"?

19:21.830 --> 19:24.240
Li Decai, you really are amusing.

19:24.680 --> 19:26.200
At this very moment,

19:26.640 --> 19:28.570
you're still shameless as you are.

19:29.110 --> 19:30.350
The Li family

19:30.510 --> 19:32.310
is no home to human scum like you.

19:32.470 --> 19:34.030
Quit your yapping!

19:34.240 --> 19:35.480
Confess right away!

19:37.200 --> 19:38.510
B-Before I confess,

19:39.200 --> 19:41.590
please let me see Chunhua once more.

19:46.960 --> 19:48.350
Do you think

19:49.070 --> 19:50.480
that today, Aunt Chunhua will

19:50.480 --> 19:51.940
come to your rescue again?

19:52.110 --> 19:53.750
I'm telling you, Li Decai,

19:54.240 --> 19:55.880
give up on that hope.

19:56.200 --> 19:57.920
Li Zhen, you little wench!

19:58.350 --> 19:59.960
Who are you to interrogate me?

19:59.960 --> 20:01.420
I demand to see Li Chunhua!

20:02.000 --> 20:03.460
I demand to see Li Chunhua!

20:04.030 --> 20:05.110
Chunhua!

20:05.640 --> 20:06.440
Chunhua!

20:06.750 --> 20:07.640
Stop with the beating!

20:07.640 --> 20:08.720
Chunhua!

20:11.830 --> 20:13.270
Chunhua!

20:13.310 --> 20:15.240
Chunhua!

20:15.240 --> 20:15.640
Zhen,

20:15.640 --> 20:16.720
stop it.

20:18.510 --> 20:19.750
Chunhua...

20:25.270 --> 20:26.030
Chunhua.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.030
Chunhua!

20:27.030 --> 20:28.920
Chunhua...

20:29.420 --> 20:31.030
You finally came.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.270
Chunhua,

20:33.400 --> 20:34.400
I know I did wrong.

20:34.400 --> 20:36.640
This time, I really know I did wrong.

20:36.640 --> 20:37.350
Chunhua,

20:37.440 --> 20:38.400
save me.

20:38.480 --> 20:40.160
P-Please put in a good word for me.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.420
Don't do it for my sake.

20:41.880 --> 20:44.030
Do it for Run's sake.

20:44.030 --> 20:44.830
Chunhua...

20:48.960 --> 20:50.110
Li Decai,

20:50.640 --> 20:52.900
you're not worthy of being Run's father.

21:00.350 --> 21:01.310
I've drafted

21:01.920 --> 21:03.120
a divorce agreement.

21:06.000 --> 21:06.880
Chunhua.

21:07.920 --> 21:08.750
Chunhua.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.200
Chunhua!

21:11.270 --> 21:12.160
Zhen,

21:12.920 --> 21:14.160
take whatever action

21:14.440 --> 21:15.680
as you see fit.

21:16.680 --> 21:18.480
No need to consider my feelings.

21:20.110 --> 21:20.790
Chunhua.

21:20.880 --> 21:21.550
Don't go, Chunhua.

21:21.550 --> 21:22.790
Chunhua! Chunhua!

21:23.000 --> 21:24.310
Li Chunhua!

21:33.550 --> 21:34.240
Mother.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.870
Mother, you finally woke up.

21:40.960 --> 21:42.400
I'm so unfilial.

21:42.480 --> 21:44.880
I should have stayed by your side.

21:45.480 --> 21:46.590
No worries.

21:47.070 --> 21:48.110
But, Mother,

21:51.240 --> 21:53.440
I really did wrong.

21:55.030 --> 21:56.790
Please punish me, Mother!

22:00.880 --> 22:01.720
Mother!

22:03.640 --> 22:04.400
Mother!

22:19.480 --> 22:21.280
Are you feeling better, Mother?

22:28.270 --> 22:29.240
Come on.

22:30.510 --> 22:32.150
Sit beside me,

22:32.920 --> 22:35.640
so I can have a word with you.

22:37.000 --> 22:37.920
Get up.

22:43.510 --> 22:44.240
Mother.

22:47.750 --> 22:49.310
I am partially to blame

22:50.160 --> 22:52.720
for this matter.

22:54.680 --> 22:56.550
Thirteen years ago,

22:59.070 --> 23:00.790
the Eighth Branch

23:02.480 --> 23:06.000
was expelled from the clan
when I was in charge.

23:09.160 --> 23:12.790
At that time, I was in a position

23:13.200 --> 23:14.790
where I had no choice

23:15.960 --> 23:18.680
but to make that decision.

23:20.440 --> 23:21.720
Now,

23:23.270 --> 23:26.530
the Eighth Branch hasn't been accepted
back into the clan,

23:26.750 --> 23:30.160
and the Li family is torn apart.

23:31.750 --> 23:32.640
I...

23:34.000 --> 23:35.270
have let...

23:35.960 --> 23:37.110
have let down

23:37.720 --> 23:39.720
our ancestors.

23:41.790 --> 23:42.480
Mother...

23:46.510 --> 23:49.550
I swear to bring the Eighth Branch back.

23:52.440 --> 23:53.880
And the first step of it

23:55.000 --> 23:56.880
is to let Zhen shoulder

23:58.720 --> 24:02.270
the responsibility
of managing the Li family.

24:03.310 --> 24:04.920
I know

24:07.110 --> 24:08.480
what is on your mind.

24:10.270 --> 24:12.030
I also know

24:13.110 --> 24:15.200
what is on your mind.

24:16.160 --> 24:17.680
Normally,

24:18.510 --> 24:21.030
the backbone of the Seventh Branch

24:21.720 --> 24:23.440
should be Zhengyou.

24:26.510 --> 24:28.200
That was also

24:29.400 --> 24:32.350
my original plan.

24:33.000 --> 24:35.160
But as you could see,

24:36.400 --> 24:37.640
Li Ink

24:38.350 --> 24:41.200
is declining year by year.

24:44.310 --> 24:47.270
If, right now, there is no one

24:47.720 --> 24:49.720
able to sustain

24:50.510 --> 24:52.790
this huge ink workshop,

24:54.200 --> 24:56.480
by the time Zhengyou grows up,

24:57.640 --> 24:58.310
Li...

25:00.310 --> 25:03.510
Li Ink

25:06.550 --> 25:10.350
will have crumbled.

25:11.200 --> 25:11.920
Mother,

25:13.030 --> 25:15.310
I know what to do.

25:16.230 --> 25:17.430
Don't worry, Mother.

25:18.830 --> 25:20.090
Seventh Grandmother!

25:22.160 --> 25:23.420
Seventh Grandmother.

25:25.640 --> 25:26.510
Zhen.

25:27.270 --> 25:28.160
Eldest Aunt.

25:31.750 --> 25:33.010
Seventh Grandmother,

25:33.270 --> 25:34.920
Li Decai has made a full confession.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.880
It was Tian Jiangyue

25:35.880 --> 25:37.110
who orchestrated the entire

25:37.110 --> 25:39.720
isinglass scheme
from the beginning to the end.

25:39.720 --> 25:41.880
Li Decai colluded
with that isinglass dealer

25:41.880 --> 25:43.610
and worked with the Tian family

25:43.790 --> 25:46.650
to attack us while we were busy
producing Shize Ink.

25:46.960 --> 25:47.960
I've told Doggie

25:47.960 --> 25:49.890
to guard Tian Jiangyue's bedroom.

25:49.920 --> 25:51.380
As for how to deal with her,

25:51.440 --> 25:53.240
is entirely up to you,
Seventh Grandmother.

25:53.240 --> 25:55.240
I'd like to go meet her.

25:55.680 --> 25:57.200
Help me up.

25:57.750 --> 25:58.680
Manager Zhen.

25:59.030 --> 26:01.110
Fourth Young Lady has gone missing.

26:01.310 --> 26:02.200
Missing?

26:02.310 --> 26:03.200
How did that happen?

26:03.200 --> 26:04.350
We've searched the entire residence,

26:04.350 --> 26:06.080
yet she was nowhere to be found.

26:06.160 --> 26:08.020
She's probably at Yuliang Wharf.

26:08.440 --> 26:09.640
On this day

26:09.880 --> 26:11.110
in the each of these 13 years,

26:11.110 --> 26:13.970
she would burn paper money for Jingqi
at that place.

26:17.270 --> 26:18.240
Old Madam,

26:18.350 --> 26:20.220
someone pried the lock
of the ancestral hall

26:20.220 --> 26:22.160
and stole Young Master Jingqi's
spirit tablet!

26:22.160 --> 26:22.960
What?

26:23.510 --> 26:24.510
Now,

26:25.030 --> 26:27.070
go to the wharf.

26:27.160 --> 26:27.880
This is bad.

26:31.550 --> 26:35.080
[Spirit Tablet of Jingqi,
Son of the Li Family in Ming]

26:32.270 --> 26:33.400
Jingqi.

26:35.440 --> 26:36.830
This year's autumn

26:37.640 --> 26:39.400
feels so cold.

26:42.440 --> 26:44.200
When I sleep at night,

26:44.550 --> 26:46.720
my hands and feet are freezing.

26:48.350 --> 26:49.480
In the past,

26:50.310 --> 26:52.570
you would always fill my hot water bottle

26:53.400 --> 26:55.510
and tuck me in before going to bed.

26:56.960 --> 26:58.220
When will you come back

26:59.720 --> 27:01.480
and warm up the bed for me again?

27:07.200 --> 27:09.730
But it's a good thing
that you won't come back.

27:10.400 --> 27:11.440
The family

27:12.480 --> 27:14.680
is no longer what it used to be.

27:17.750 --> 27:19.270
Our enemy

27:19.510 --> 27:21.440
is now boldly and openly

27:21.720 --> 27:23.640
in charge of the Li family.

27:25.590 --> 27:26.350
Mother,

27:27.160 --> 27:28.090
Sister-in-law,

27:28.440 --> 27:29.640
and the Third Brother

27:30.240 --> 27:33.270
all bow and scrape to her

27:33.830 --> 27:35.430
as if she's an honored guest.

27:36.920 --> 27:38.880
They have all forgotten about you.

27:41.640 --> 27:43.000
But I won't.

27:45.400 --> 27:46.310
Jingqi,

27:51.680 --> 27:53.410
I'm coming to reunite with you.

27:54.000 --> 27:55.030
Wait for me.

28:00.160 --> 28:01.550
Eldest Aunt, slow down!

28:01.640 --> 28:02.830
She really is here.

28:03.350 --> 28:04.310
Jiangyue!

28:05.790 --> 28:06.790
Jiangyue!

28:08.920 --> 28:09.880
Don't come over.

28:10.400 --> 28:11.160
Don't come near, all of you!

28:11.160 --> 28:11.830
Jiangyue!

28:11.830 --> 28:13.070
Stay where you are!

28:13.070 --> 28:14.720
I'll jump if you come any closer!

28:14.720 --> 28:15.640
Stay away!

28:15.680 --> 28:16.640
Stay away!

28:17.030 --> 28:18.720
We are not going over.

28:19.790 --> 28:20.590
Jiangyue.

28:21.270 --> 28:23.070
Jiangyue, I won't go over there.

28:23.110 --> 28:25.110
Just don't hurt yourself, alright?

28:25.440 --> 28:27.200
Mother has come to.

28:27.720 --> 28:29.180
Not seeing you by her side,

28:29.400 --> 28:30.860
she thought you'd be here.

28:30.960 --> 28:32.680
So she asked us to come bring you home.

28:32.680 --> 28:34.270
She wants a word with you.

28:34.510 --> 28:36.070
Let's go home, shall we?

28:36.270 --> 28:37.200
Sister-in-law,

28:37.510 --> 28:39.160
don't try to coax me.

28:39.270 --> 28:40.790
In Mother's heart...

28:40.920 --> 28:41.550
Doggie,

28:41.640 --> 28:42.590
tell Zhen I'm here.

28:42.590 --> 28:43.320
Come with me!

28:44.240 --> 28:45.590
The Li family and Li Ink

28:45.590 --> 28:48.350
are more important than her own son.

28:48.350 --> 28:49.200
Manager Zhen,

28:50.270 --> 28:50.960
Master Qi is here.

28:50.960 --> 28:52.960
I jeopardized the Li family.

28:52.960 --> 28:53.590
I got it.

28:53.680 --> 28:55.200
Given the family rules,

28:55.750 --> 28:57.610
will I be spared from punishment?

28:58.920 --> 29:01.320
Instead of kneeling in the ancestral hall,

29:01.640 --> 29:04.680
being taken to trial by you hypocrites,

29:05.030 --> 29:06.830
and begging for a shred of mercy,

29:08.880 --> 29:10.160
I'd rather reunite...

29:10.640 --> 29:11.510
Jiangyue!

29:14.680 --> 29:16.550
with Jingqi in the nether world tonight.

29:16.550 --> 29:18.110
Jiangyue, don't do anything silly.

29:18.110 --> 29:19.640
I'm begging you!

29:41.510 --> 29:42.590
Tian Jiangyue!

29:43.590 --> 29:45.750
What's so great about seeking death?

29:46.310 --> 29:48.240
You've been domineering for days.

29:48.510 --> 29:50.710
Don't make me look down on you at the end!

29:52.960 --> 29:54.920
Don't you long to chase me away?

29:55.590 --> 29:56.550
Bring it on.

29:56.880 --> 29:58.880
Fight me for a few more rounds!

29:59.350 --> 30:01.310
What, are you afraid now?

30:01.550 --> 30:03.210
Are you going to admit defeat?

30:03.550 --> 30:04.590
Tian Jiangyue,

30:04.960 --> 30:06.440
I despise you.

30:06.680 --> 30:07.790
I truly think of you

30:08.270 --> 30:10.030
as a coward!

30:16.550 --> 30:17.350
Let go...

30:17.720 --> 30:18.310
Doggie!

30:18.590 --> 30:19.480
Jingqi!

30:19.480 --> 30:20.000
Calm down!

30:20.000 --> 30:21.000
Jingqi!

30:22.110 --> 30:23.110
Jingqi!

30:24.200 --> 30:25.400
Let go of me!

30:25.440 --> 30:27.200
Let go of me...

30:27.480 --> 30:28.510
Let go of me!

30:28.510 --> 30:30.170
I want to reunite with Jingqi!

30:30.240 --> 30:31.110
Jingqi!

30:31.590 --> 30:32.960
Jingqi!

30:34.310 --> 30:35.400
Jingqi!

30:38.640 --> 30:39.510
Jingqi...

30:54.350 --> 30:55.610
Seventh Grandmother,

30:56.070 --> 30:57.510
why are you up?

31:00.720 --> 31:01.920
Zhen,

31:02.200 --> 31:03.750
where is your fourth aunt?

31:03.830 --> 31:04.590
In the main hall.

31:04.590 --> 31:06.390
Uncle Jingdong is watching her.

31:07.720 --> 31:09.240
Go there with me then.

31:10.160 --> 31:12.070
It is time you got to know some things

31:12.070 --> 31:13.400
about the family,

31:13.400 --> 31:15.600
since you're head of the household now.

31:15.960 --> 31:17.110
Seventh Grandmother,

31:17.110 --> 31:18.350
you just woke up from a coma.

31:18.350 --> 31:19.270
You shouldn't strain yourself.

31:19.270 --> 31:20.680
What if you catch a cold?

31:20.680 --> 31:21.510
Go back inside.

31:21.510 --> 31:22.920
Leave everything to us.

31:23.310 --> 31:25.040
Just go to the main hall with me.

31:29.790 --> 31:30.830
Li Jingdong,

31:31.000 --> 31:32.750
you're a coward!

31:32.750 --> 31:33.960
You are incompetent!

31:34.510 --> 31:36.070
If you hadn't surrendered,

31:36.070 --> 31:36.750
how could this girl

31:36.750 --> 31:38.590
throw her weight around in the family

31:38.590 --> 31:40.830
and boss us around?

31:41.070 --> 31:42.960
Don't forget we're senior to her.

31:46.070 --> 31:48.720
There are no morals or rules

31:48.830 --> 31:50.310
in this family anymore.

31:51.030 --> 31:54.000
It's about to fall apart.

31:56.030 --> 31:58.880
You'd better put me under watch
all the time,

31:59.070 --> 32:01.160
or I'll kill myself by hitting the wall

32:01.160 --> 32:03.030
or hanging myself in the Li residence,

32:03.030 --> 32:04.430
so that everyone will see

32:04.590 --> 32:05.920
how a daughter-in-law

32:05.960 --> 32:08.400
of the Li family is driven to death
by you lot!

32:08.400 --> 32:09.510
Let go of me.

32:16.350 --> 32:17.160
Mother.

32:17.960 --> 32:18.720
Mother.

32:19.590 --> 32:20.400
Mother...

32:24.790 --> 32:26.270
Zhen, you stay put.

32:26.790 --> 32:29.320
Jingdong, go back to your room
with your wife.

32:30.070 --> 32:31.680
Wanyi, off you go as well.

32:32.550 --> 32:34.880
Servants, leave and stay behind the door.

32:59.880 --> 33:01.400
Jiangyue,

33:02.920 --> 33:04.270
I heard

33:05.680 --> 33:08.160
Jingqi's spirit tablet was gone.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.480
But don't worry.

33:12.110 --> 33:16.070
I have sent someone to procure fine wood

33:16.750 --> 33:19.000
to make a new one.

33:19.680 --> 33:22.750
We will place it properly

33:23.550 --> 33:25.830
in the ancestral hall,

33:26.310 --> 33:27.720
alright?

33:31.110 --> 33:32.000
Mother.

33:39.510 --> 33:41.070
As his mother,

33:42.510 --> 33:44.750
you finally think of Jingqi, your son,

33:45.110 --> 33:47.110
at this time.

33:48.440 --> 33:49.550
The one who caused his death

33:49.550 --> 33:51.680
is standing right behind you.

33:58.880 --> 34:00.270
Jiangyue,

34:01.400 --> 34:02.270
come on,

34:02.790 --> 34:04.750
let me hold your hand.

34:10.150 --> 34:11.510
Jiangyue,

34:13.000 --> 34:14.360
I know

34:15.150 --> 34:16.590
you've been thinking

34:18.590 --> 34:22.920
about Jingqi all the time,

34:23.840 --> 34:24.880
right?

34:29.000 --> 34:30.800
When Jingqi passed away,

34:31.320 --> 34:32.920
I thought

34:33.710 --> 34:36.960
if you didn't want to stay
in the Li family,

34:37.960 --> 34:41.000
I wouldn't force you to.

34:43.440 --> 34:45.590
Who would've known

34:46.840 --> 34:48.670
you still chose to be committed

34:50.480 --> 34:52.670
to him for the rest of your life?

35:21.550 --> 35:24.360
What was your prayer
to the Flower Goddess?

35:24.840 --> 35:27.190
Can you tell me?

35:27.670 --> 35:30.400
Why ask for so much detail?

35:31.550 --> 35:33.030
It was nothing...

35:33.710 --> 35:35.280
more than an ordinary wish.

35:35.510 --> 35:37.880
Your wish is certainly my wish.

35:38.190 --> 35:39.280
Now tell me about it,

35:39.280 --> 35:41.140
so I can always keep it in my heart.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.510
Actually,

35:44.190 --> 35:45.760
it was nothing special.

35:46.150 --> 35:48.320
I only prayed that our family

35:48.630 --> 35:50.110
could always be safe,

35:50.710 --> 35:53.670
happy, and harmonious

35:53.710 --> 35:55.150
year after year

35:56.440 --> 35:57.800
when we had children.

35:58.000 --> 35:59.400
Jiangyue, rest assured.

35:59.440 --> 36:01.400
As long as I am still in the family,

36:01.840 --> 36:03.500
I won't let you ever get upset.

36:04.230 --> 36:06.320
I promise to protect you for a lifetime

36:06.320 --> 36:08.850
and build a good life
for you and our children.

36:19.590 --> 36:21.920
Over these years,

36:23.030 --> 36:25.880
when you cause kerfuffles
every now and then,

36:27.510 --> 36:30.440
I would always give in.

36:33.550 --> 36:36.760
It's because from the bottom of my heart,

36:37.230 --> 36:38.840
I truly respect you,

36:39.760 --> 36:41.360
and I feel deeply

36:42.000 --> 36:44.480
sorry for you.

36:47.510 --> 36:48.880
The Li family

36:50.280 --> 36:51.630
is a great clan

36:53.070 --> 36:55.070
that has carried on its legacy

36:55.630 --> 36:58.320
for hundreds of years in Huizhou.

37:00.190 --> 37:02.960
We have established rules

37:03.760 --> 37:06.400
for our descendants' marriages.

37:07.480 --> 37:09.190
Jingyuan passed away early.

37:10.230 --> 37:12.670
The Seventh Branch is the legitimate line.

37:14.510 --> 37:16.710
My son, Jingqi,

37:17.320 --> 37:20.550
was supposed to inherit
the family business.

37:21.710 --> 37:22.590
The family

37:23.800 --> 37:28.030
had already chosen
a well-matched wife for him.

37:29.510 --> 37:31.670
Initially, I never gave

37:32.630 --> 37:34.360
my consent

37:35.550 --> 37:37.110
to him marrying you.

37:38.840 --> 37:39.960
Later,

37:40.670 --> 37:43.360
Jingfu and Jingqi

37:44.960 --> 37:46.800
knelt before my chamber

37:47.440 --> 37:51.670
for two whole days and nights.

37:58.070 --> 38:00.280
As a mother,

38:04.510 --> 38:06.000
I finally relented.

38:08.840 --> 38:11.070
At that time, I thought to myself,

38:11.840 --> 38:14.590
that I must go in person

38:16.630 --> 38:18.670
to see this girl

38:19.510 --> 38:22.550
who my son was so determined to marry.

38:25.400 --> 38:27.760
That day was still vivid in my mind.

38:28.480 --> 38:30.320
I was seated at your home,

38:31.670 --> 38:34.320
while you walked towards me

38:35.510 --> 38:38.840
and greeted me with perfect propriety.

38:39.590 --> 38:41.880
You were so lovable.

38:45.320 --> 38:47.150
Then you finished the act

38:47.150 --> 38:49.960
and looked up at me. At that moment,

38:51.440 --> 38:52.630
I...

38:55.800 --> 38:57.800
I knew right then

38:58.440 --> 39:02.190
you were destined to be
a daughter-in-law of the Li family.

39:05.030 --> 39:05.920
Mother.

39:07.030 --> 39:08.000
Mother...

39:12.280 --> 39:17.230
You and Jingqi made
solemn pledges of love.

39:17.230 --> 39:18.890
Your romance was passionate.

39:20.030 --> 39:21.760
But within just six months,

39:22.400 --> 39:23.550
Jingqi...

39:24.190 --> 39:26.000
passed away.

39:27.440 --> 39:30.000
At least, Jingyuan left his wife

39:30.510 --> 39:32.360
with a son.

39:34.280 --> 39:36.670
But what about Jingqi?

39:38.880 --> 39:39.880
Jiangyue,

39:42.440 --> 39:44.920
I just have one question for you.

39:45.710 --> 39:47.190
In your whole life,

39:48.000 --> 39:49.440
who really wronged you?

39:50.510 --> 39:52.670
Was it Jingqi,

39:53.320 --> 39:56.230
or the Li family?

39:56.920 --> 39:57.670
Mother,

39:59.280 --> 40:00.760
over all these years,

40:01.840 --> 40:04.960
I couldn't have lived to this very moment

40:05.670 --> 40:07.590
without the hatred in my heart.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.800
Then tell me!

40:10.480 --> 40:14.440
Do you hate the Eighth Branch,

40:14.440 --> 40:17.070
or yourself?

40:20.360 --> 40:22.490
When you just married into the family,

40:22.800 --> 40:25.590
you were overly ambitious

40:26.110 --> 40:29.370
and constantly egging Jingqi
on to stand out in the family.

40:29.550 --> 40:32.670
You even pushed him to fight and compete

40:32.670 --> 40:36.230
for the task of escorting
the Tribute Ink to the Capital.

40:37.320 --> 40:39.480
Jingqi was in such a tough spot

40:40.320 --> 40:42.230
that he had no choice

40:43.670 --> 40:46.280
but to turn to me in private.

40:48.510 --> 40:50.190
That was why

40:51.400 --> 40:53.800
I decided to let

40:54.960 --> 40:57.480
the three brothers of them

40:58.030 --> 41:00.400
set out for the Capital together.

41:05.030 --> 41:08.440
I made them go to the Capital together.

41:11.800 --> 41:13.440
You must

41:14.190 --> 41:16.670
remember this clearly.

41:18.360 --> 41:19.550
It was not my fault.

41:20.440 --> 41:21.510
I didn't cause that.

41:21.510 --> 41:23.880
It couldn't have been because of me.

41:24.320 --> 41:26.800
I was never involved.

41:27.480 --> 41:28.920
It was not my fault, Mother.

41:28.920 --> 41:30.070
It was not.

41:32.470 --> 41:33.710
You...

41:34.550 --> 41:36.630
Look at yourself.

41:37.320 --> 41:38.550
What have you been

41:38.960 --> 41:42.070
reduced to after all these years?

41:43.960 --> 41:46.490
If Jingqi knew about this
in the nether world,

41:47.550 --> 41:50.070
could he rest in peace?

41:51.920 --> 41:53.360
If...

41:54.880 --> 41:58.670
you still think of me as your mother,

41:59.960 --> 42:04.510
then let go of all your hatred

42:06.480 --> 42:10.590
and start living a better life
from now on.

42:17.710 --> 42:18.880
In addition,

42:20.400 --> 42:22.280
no matter what,

42:23.400 --> 42:24.880
do not give up

42:25.230 --> 42:26.960
your own life.

42:31.400 --> 42:32.430
Zhen,

42:33.760 --> 42:36.000
you're head of the family now.

42:36.800 --> 42:38.070
This matter

42:38.590 --> 42:40.190
is yours to handle.

42:51.360 --> 42:52.150
Mother.

42:52.920 --> 42:53.840
Mother!

42:54.800 --> 42:55.670
Mother...
